MeshBoolean CSG difference is a stub (mesh-difference returns the input unchanged, so self-difference yields the mesh, not the empty set the .expected pins). The compile path (act-form opening) and float-equality (det ~0, CDX2085) are fixed here and the primitive path is pinned by spark-mesh-test; the boolean-difference geometry is not implemented. Un-skip when apps/spark/MeshBoolean.codex computes a real CSG difference.
